### Teste: Listar Contas a Receber de uma Venda Específica
GET http://localhost:3000/financial/accounts-receivable?companyId={{companyId}}&saleId={{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Teste: Listar Todas as Contas a Receber com Vendas Vinculadas
GET http://localhost:3000/financial/accounts-receivable?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Teste: Listar Movimentações de Estoque de uma Venda Específica
GET http://localhost:3000/products/stock-movements?companyId={{companyId}}&saleId={{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Teste: Listar Todas as Movimentações com Vendas Vinculadas
GET http://localhost:3000/products/stock-movements?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Teste: Buscar Conta a Receber Individual (com venda vinculada)
GET http://localhost:3000/financial/accounts-receivable/{{receivableId}}?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Teste Completo: Aprovar Venda e Verificar Vínculos

# 1. Criar venda
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "status": "QUOTE",
  "installments": 3,
  "paymentMethodId": "{{paymentMethodId}}",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 10,
      "unitPrice": 50.00,
      "stockLocationId": "{{locationId}}"
    }
  ]
}

# Salvar: {{saleId}}

###

# 2. Aprovar venda
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{saleId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

# 3. Verificar contas a receber criadas
GET http://localhost:3000/financial/accounts-receivable?companyId={{companyId}}&saleId={{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Deve retornar 3 contas a receber com:
# - sale.id = saleId
# - sale.code = código da venda
# - sale.customer = dados do cliente

###

# 4. Verificar movimentações de estoque criadas
GET http://localhost:3000/products/stock-movements?companyId={{companyId}}&saleId={{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Deve retornar 1 movimentação com:
# - type = EXIT
# - quantity = -10
# - sale.id = saleId
# - sale.code = código da venda

###

# 5. Cancelar venda
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{saleId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cancellationReason": "Teste de cancelamento"
}

###

# 6. Verificar contas canceladas
GET http://localhost:3000/financial/accounts-receivable?companyId={{companyId}}&saleId={{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Deve retornar as 3 contas com status = CANCELADO

###

# 7. Verificar devolução de estoque
GET http://localhost:3000/products/stock-movements?companyId={{companyId}}&saleId={{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Deve retornar 2 movimentações:
# 1. EXIT (saída original)
# 2. RETURN (devolução)

###

### Teste: Filtrar Contas a Receber por Status e Venda
GET http://localhost:3000/financial/accounts-receivable?companyId={{companyId}}&status=PENDENTE&saleId={{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Teste: Filtrar Movimentações por Tipo e Venda
GET http://localhost:3000/products/stock-movements?companyId={{companyId}}&type=EXIT&saleId={{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

